### Non-Code / External Launch Prerequisites (Pending Developer Account Approval)
While all code is release-ready, the following operational steps are required once your Google Play Developer Account and Apple Developer Program enrolments are active:

1. **Xcode Background Assets Target & Entitlements (iOS)**
   - Create the BADownloaderExtension target in Xcode.
   - Enable the group.com.payslipmax.pdfparser.gemma App Group entitlement on both the main app and extension target (requires active Apple Developer signing profile).
   - Add model download URL keys to Info.plist.
2. **In-App Purchase Product Configuration**
   - Create subscription IDs (pro_monthly, pro_yearly) in Google Play Console and App Store Connect to link to the implemented native billing engines.
3. **Google Play 14-Day / 20-Tester Policy**
   - Complete Google Play's mandatory 14-day closed testing requirement with 20 opted-in testers before production publishing (applicable to new personal developer accounts).

